WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.493
VectorMapNet sets a new state of the art.

00:00:03.573 --> 00:00:09.157
It beats HDMapNet by 14.2 mAP on nuScenes and 14.6
on Argoverse2.

00:00:09.237 --> 00:00:15.082
Gains hold across sensors: nearly eighteen points
camera, ten LiDAR,

00:00:15.162 --> 00:00:16.912
over fourteen fusion.

00:00:16.992 --> 00:00:22.140
Two-stage fine-tuning pushes fusion to 53.7 mAP
versus 31.0.
